OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer's knife left in
OL,4,Awoods for three days
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: The following report contains
OL,7,Fdetails that some may find distressing
OL,9,FA bloodstained knife and blanket later
OL,10,Fforensically linked to a triple killer
OL,11,Fwere reported to police three days
OL,12,Fbefore the murders but not recovered
OL,13,Funtil afterwards, the BBC has learned.
OL,15,FThey were found by a member of the
OL,16,Fpublic in woods at Costessey, near
OL,17,FNorwich, close to the home of
OL,18,FBartlomiej Kuczynski, who is thought to
OL,19,Fhave killed his two daughters and
OL,20,Fsister-in-law, and then himself.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
